---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy of Talha M Blog: what information we collect, how we use it, and your choices.">
  <section class="article-head"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p><em>Last updated: October 11, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>Talha M Blog (talhablog.com) is a news and information blog written in simple English. This page explains what information is collected when you visit this website and how it is used.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Information you send us:</b> If you email us, we receive your email address and the contents of your message. We use it only to reply to you.</li>
      <li><b>Basic technical logs:</b> Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may record basic technical information such as your IP address, browser type and pages visited, to keep the site secure and working.</li>
      <li><b>Theme preference:</b> If you switch between light and dark mode, that choice is saved only in your own browser (local storage). It is not sent to us.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not have user accounts, we do not run a comments system, and we do not sell personal information to anyone.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>This website itself does not set tracking cookies. If we show advertising in the future, for example through Google AdSense, the advertising provider may use cookies to show ads based on your visits to this and other websites. You can turn off personalized advertising in your Google Ads settings or in your browser settings.</p>

    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>Our articles may link to other websites for sources and further reading. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those websites.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>This website is a general-audience news site. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If this policy changes, the new version will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>For any question about this policy, email us via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
